"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([["7547"],{73504(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"17.32.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.32.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/17.32.0.mdx","title":"Release 17.32.0","description":"Sedan 17.26.0 har Modal f\xe5tt ny design och en sticky footer, Stack har tillkommit, FileList visar uppladdningsf\xf6rlopp och Calendar har f\xe5tt en m\xe5nads- och \xe5rsv\xe4ljare.","date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v17","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-17"}],"readingTime":4.5,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"17.32.0","title":"Release 17.32.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v17"],"date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Release 17.26.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.26.0"}},"content":"Sedan 17.26.0 har `Modal` f\xe5tt ny design och en sticky footer, `Stack` har tillkommit, `FileList` visar uppladdningsf\xf6rlopp och `Calendar` har f\xe5tt en m\xe5nads- och \xe5rsv\xe4ljare.\\n\\n| Paket                  | Version   |\\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\\n| `@midas-ds/components` | `17.32.0` |\\n| `@midas-ds/layout`     | `0.2.54`  |\\n| `@midas-ds/theme`      | `3.17.8`  |\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## \u{1F195} Ny komponent: Stack\\n\\n`Stack` placerar children i en riktning, med standardavst\xe5nd fr\xe5n Midas semantiska space-tokens. En f\xf6renklad flexbox helt enkelt!\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { Stack, Button } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n\\n;<Stack\\n  direction=\'row\'\\n  spacing=\'medium\'\\n  justifyContent=\'end\'\\n>\\n  <Button variant=\'secondary\'>Avbryt</Button>\\n  <Button>Spara</Button>\\n</Stack>\\n```\\n\\n`spacing` tar `xsmall`\u2013`xlarge` (standard `small`). Med `elementType` v\xe4ljer du vilket element som renderas, t.ex. `ul` f\xf6r en lista. Se [dokumentationen](/components/stack) f\xf6r fler exempel.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n### Modal: ny design och sticky footer\\n\\n`Modal` har f\xe5tt ny design: st\xe4ngknappen visar bara en ikon (med `aria-label`), headern har ny bakgrundsf\xe4rg och paddingen \xe4r justerad. Med nya `footer`-propen hamnar handlingarna i en footer som alltid \xe4r synlig, \xe4ven n\xe4r inneh\xe5llet \xe4r l\xe5ngt.\\n\\n```tsx\\n<DialogTrigger>\\n  <Button>\xd6ppna modal</Button>\\n  <Modal\\n    title=\'Rubrik\'\\n    footer={<Button slot=\'close\'>Bekr\xe4fta</Button>}\\n  >\\n    Inneh\xe5ll i modal\\n  </Modal>\\n</DialogTrigger>\\n```\\n\\nSe [riktlinjerna](/components/modal) f\xf6r var handlingar ska placeras.\\n\\n### FileList: uppladdningsf\xf6rlopp\\n\\n`FileListItem` har f\xe5tt `status` (`idle`, `uploading`, `success`, `error`), `progress` och `errorMessage` f\xf6r att visa var i uppladdningsfl\xf6det en fil befinner sig.\\n\\n```tsx\\n<FileListItem\\n  fileName=\'video.mp4\'\\n  fileSize=\'128 MB\'\\n  status=\'uploading\'\\n  progress={40}\\n  onCancel={handleCancel}\\n/>\\n```\\n\\nSe [dokumentationen](/components/file-list).\\n\\n### ProgressBar: cirkul\xe4r variant\\n\\n`ProgressBar` kan nu renderas som en ring med `shape=\'circular\'`, och med `small` blir den 20px, lika stor som en liten `Spinner`.\\n\\n### Calendar: m\xe5nads- och \xe5rsv\xe4ljare\\n\\n`Calendar` och `RangeCalendar` kan visa m\xe5nad och \xe5r som dropdown-v\xe4ljare i headern med `showMonthYearPicker`, s\xe5 att anv\xe4ndaren kan hoppa direkt till en annan m\xe5nad eller ett annat \xe5r.\\n\\n```tsx\\n<Calendar\\n  aria-label=\'Kalender\'\\n  showMonthYearPicker\\n/>\\n```\\n\\n### Accordion: `contentBackground`\\n\\n`AccordionItem` har f\xe5tt `contentBackground` (`neutral` eller `inherit`). `hasBackground` \xe4r deprecated, `hasBackground={false}` motsvarar `contentBackground=\'inherit\'`.\\n\\n### lucide-react \xe4r nu ett beroende\\n\\n`@midas-ds/components` och `@midas-ds/layout` bundlar inte l\xe4ngre egna kopior av `lucide-react`, utan deklarerar det som beroende. Anv\xe4nder du sj\xe4lv Lucide delar ni nu p\xe5 samma kopia, och typer som `icon?: LucideIcon` p\xe5 `Button` och `Link` fungerar utan att du installerar paketet sj\xe4lv.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n### @midas-ds/components\\n\\n- **TextField**: Texten \xe4r nu nedtonad i disabled-tillst\xe5nd.\\n- **Checkbox, Radio**: `data-*`-attribut hamnar \xe5terigen p\xe5 knappen, inte p\xe5 f\xe4ltet runt. Det hade \xe4ndrats sedan de b\xf6rjade bygga p\xe5 `CheckboxField`/`RadioField`.\\n- **RangeCalendar**: Anv\xe4nder nu `commitBehavior=\'reset\'` som standard, s\xe5 att ett p\xe5b\xf6rjat val inte f\xf6rsvinner.\\n- **Calendar**: Fixat en regression i `commitBehavior` och specificiteten i kalenderns style-reset.\\n- **Typer**: Publicerade typer importerar inte l\xe4ngre odeklarerade paket. `clsx` \xe4r nu ett deklarerat beroende, `@react-types/shared` anv\xe4nds inte l\xe4ngre och `.stories.d.ts`-filer publiceras inte. Tidigare kunde du f\xe5 `any` eller fel med pnpm eller `skipLibCheck: false`.\\n- **Beroenden**: React Aria och React Spectrum \xe4r uppdaterade.\\n\\n### @midas-ds/layout\\n\\n- **Typer**: Publicerade typer importerar nu fr\xe5n `@midas-ds/components` i st\xe4llet f\xf6r s\xf6kv\xe4gar som inte finns i `node_modules`. Tidigare saknade bl.a. `PanelTitle`, `NavigationHeader`, `MobileMenu` och `HeaderAction` typer fr\xe5n components.\\n- **useMediaQuery**: Bygger nu p\xe5 `useSyncExternalStore` i st\xe4llet f\xf6r `@react-spectrum/utils`, s\xe5 paketet bundlar inte l\xe4ngre en egen kopia av React Arias SSR-kontext.\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v17.27.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.0)\\n- [components@v17.27.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.1)\\n- [components@v17.27.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.2)\\n- [components@v17.27.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.3)\\n- [components@v17.27.4](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.4)\\n- [components@v17.27.5](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.27.5)\\n- [components@v17.28.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.28.0)\\n- [components@v17.28.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.28.1)\\n- [components@v17.28.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.28.2)\\n- [components@v17.29.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.29.0)\\n- [components@v17.30.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.30.0)\\n- [components@v17.30.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.30.1)\\n- [components@v17.30.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.30.2)\\n- [components@v17.31.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.31.0)\\n- [components@v17.32.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.32.0)\\n- [layout@v0.2.40](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.40)\\n- [layout@v0.2.41](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.41)\\n- [layout@v0.2.42](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.42)\\n- [layout@v0.2.43](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.43)\\n- [layout@v0.2.44](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.44)\\n- [layout@v0.2.45](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.45)\\n- [layout@v0.2.46](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.46)\\n- [layout@v0.2.47](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.47)\\n- [layout@v0.2.48](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.48)\\n- [layout@v0.2.49](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.49)\\n- [layout@v0.2.50](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.50)\\n- [layout@v0.2.51](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.51)\\n- [layout@v0.2.52](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.52)\\n- [layout@v0.2.53](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.53)\\n- [layout@v0.2.54](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%40v0.2.54)\\n- [theme@v3.17.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.2)\\n- [theme@v3.17.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.3)\\n- [theme@v3.17.4](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.4)\\n- [theme@v3.17.5](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.5)\\n- [theme@v3.17.6](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.6)\\n- [theme@v3.17.7](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.7)\\n- [theme@v3.17.8](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%40v3.17.8)"},{"id":"17.26.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.26.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/17.26.0.mdx","title":"Release 17.26.0","description":"Sedan 17.17.3 har DropZone blivit en Midas-komponent med egna tillst\xe5nd, f\xe4lt v\xe4ljer automatiskt r\xe4tt token utifr\xe5n lager, och Checkbox/Radio har f\xe5tt nya byggstenar.","date":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v17","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-17"}],"readingTime":5.53,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"17.26.0","title":"Release 17.26.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v17"],"date":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 17.32.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.32.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 17.17.3","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.17.3"}},"content":"Sedan 17.17.3 har DropZone blivit en Midas-komponent med egna tillst\xe5nd, f\xe4lt v\xe4ljer automatiskt r\xe4tt token utifr\xe5n lager, och Checkbox/Radio har f\xe5tt nya byggstenar.\\n\\n| Paket                  | Version   |\\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\\n| `@midas-ds/components` | `17.26.0` |\\n| `@midas-ds/layout`     | `0.2.39`  |\\n| `@midas-ds/theme`      | `3.17.1`  |\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## \u{1F195} Ny komponent: DropZone\\n\\n`DropZone` \xe4r nu en Midas-komponent med visuell representation f\xf6r samtliga tillst\xe5nd.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { DropZone, FileTrigger, Button, Text } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\nimport { Upload } from \'lucide-react\'\\n\\n<DropZone\\n  onDrop={handleDrop}\\n  aria-label=\'Dra och sl\xe4pp filer h\xe4r\'\\n>\\n  <Text slot=\'label\'>Dra och sl\xe4pp filer h\xe4r</Text>\\n  <FileTrigger onSelect={handleSelect}>\\n    <Button variant=\'secondary\'>\\n      <Upload aria-hidden size={20} />\\n      V\xe4lj filer\\n    </Button>\\n  </FileTrigger>\\n</DropZone>\\n```\\n\\nS\xe4tt alltid `aria-label` p\xe5 `DropZone` f\xf6r att h\xe5lla den tillg\xe4nglig. Se [dokumentationen](/components/dropzone) f\xf6r fler exempel, bland annat validering och filtypsbegr\xe4nsning.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n### F\xe4lt v\xe4ljer r\xe4tt token utifr\xe5n lager\\n\\nSelect, ComboBox, DateField m.fl. v\xe4ljer nu `field-01` eller `field-02` automatiskt, beroende p\xe5 om f\xe4ltet ligger direkt p\xe5 bakgrunden eller inuti en `Card`/`Accordion`. Disabled-tillst\xe5ndet f\xf6ljer med. Tidigare fick f\xe4lt fel f\xe4rg i `Card`.\\n\\n### Checkbox och Radio: nya byggstenar\\n\\nRAC har fasat ut `Checkbox`/`Radio` till f\xf6rm\xe5n f\xf6r `CheckboxButton`/`CheckboxField` och `RadioButton`/`RadioField`. Midas `Checkbox` och `Radio` bygger nu p\xe5 dem internt och exporteras \xe4ven separat om du vill bygga eget. API:et \xe4r of\xf6r\xe4ndrat.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { CheckboxButton, CheckboxField } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n```\\n\\n### SearchField: etikett och beskrivning\\n\\n`SearchField` st\xf6der nu `label` och `description`, precis som \xf6vriga f\xe4lt.\\n\\n### ListBox: opt-out fr\xe5n virtualisering\\n\\n`ListBox` (och d\xe4rmed `Select`/`ComboBox`) kan nu v\xe4lja bort virtualisering med `virtualized={false}` via `listBoxProps`. Anv\xe4ndbart om du testar utanf\xf6r en riktig webbl\xe4sare, eller om du av andra sk\xe4l vill st\xe4nga av den. Standardbeteendet \xe4r of\xf6r\xe4ndrat.\\n\\n### Select: pressed state\\n\\n`Select` har nu ett synligt pressed state p\xe5 trigger.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n### @midas-ds/components\\n\\n- **DatePicker, DateRangePicker**: Kraschade tidigare med \\"Invalid slot \'errorMessage\'\\" s\xe5 fort en egen `validate`-funktion gjorde f\xe4ltet ogiltigt. Orsaken var ett fel uppstr\xf6ms i RAC 1.20, l\xf6st genom att ta bort en on\xf6dig `Dialog`-wrapper runt kalender-popover.\\n- **Select, ComboBox, DatePicker, SearchField**: Knappen i hj\xe4lp-popover fungerar nu korrekt igen.\\n- **ListBox, Select, ComboBox**: Rubriker har inte l\xe4ngre en fast h\xf6jd, s\xe5 l\xe4ngre texter klipps inte.\\n- **Select**: Popover t\xe4cker inte l\xe4ngre nedre kanten p\xe5 trigger.\\n- **Select**: \\"V\xe4lj alla\\" r\xf6r inte l\xe4ngre disabled-alternativ och r\xe4knar bara riktiga alternativ.\\n- **Checkbox**: \\"V\xe4lj alla\\" i CheckboxGroup f\xf6ljer nu samma disabled-regel som \xf6vriga alternativ.\\n- **Badge**: Stannar nu i ikonets h\xf6rn oavsett hur smala containrar \xe4r.\\n- **Table**: Valbara rader visar nu `cursor: pointer`.\\n- **Tabs**: Animerar inte l\xe4ngre n\xe4r de anv\xe4nds inuti en dialog.\\n- **Calendar**: Nu generisk \xf6ver `selectionMode`, vilket \xf6ppnar f\xf6r `selectionMode=\'multiple\'` l\xe4ngre fram. Kr\xe4ver RAC 1.20.\\n- **Label (InfoPopover)**: Fokusringen klipps inte l\xe4ngre av efterf\xf6ljande f\xe4lt.\\n- **Link**: `RouterProvider` exporteras nu explicit, s\xe5 den \xf6verlever tree-shaking.\\n- **Popover**: Anv\xe4nder nu r\xe4tt `field-02`-tokens.\\n- **ProgressBar**: Bakgrundsf\xe4rger anv\xe4nder nu semantiska tokens i st\xe4llet f\xf6r h\xe5rdkodade.\\n\\n### @midas-ds/layout\\n\\n- **Navbar**: D\xf6ljs nu p\xe5 desktop med CSS. Tidigare fick varje konsument skriva sin egen `useMediaQuery`.\\n- **Sidebar, Navbar, Panel**: Har nu en enhetlig mobilbrytpunkt (640px) \xf6ver hela paketet.\\n- **Sidebar**: Bredden kan nu styras via CSS custom properties.\\n- **Main**: Fungerar nu som en positioneringskontext f\xf6r fixed/absolut positionerat inneh\xe5ll.\\n- **NavigationLink**: Text och ikon \xe4r nu nedtonade i disabled-tillst\xe5nd.\\n- **Navigation**: Fixat ett typecheck-fel orsakat av en inkompatibel `@react-aria/collections`-version.\\n\\n### @midas-ds/theme\\n\\n- **Layer accent**: `layer-accent-02` har nu samma v\xe4rden som `layer-accent-01`.\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v17.18.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.18.0)\\n- [components@v17.19.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.19.0)\\n- [components@v17.20.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.20.0)\\n- [components@v17.21.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.21.0)\\n- [components@v17.21.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.21.1)\\n- [components@v17.21.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.21.2)\\n- [components@v17.22.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.22.0)\\n- [components@v17.23.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.0)\\n- [components@v17.23.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.1)\\n- [components@v17.23.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.2)\\n- [components@v17.23.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.3)\\n- [components@v17.23.4](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.4)\\n- [components@v17.23.5](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.5)\\n- [components@v17.23.6](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.6)\\n- [components@v17.23.7](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.7)\\n- [components@v17.23.8](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.8)\\n- [components@v17.23.9](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.23.9)\\n- [components@v17.24.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.24.0)\\n- [components@v17.25.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.25.0)\\n- [components@v17.25.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.25.1)\\n- [components@v17.25.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.25.2)\\n- [components@v17.26.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.26.0)\\n- [layout@v0.2.12](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.12)\\n- [layout@v0.2.13](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.13)\\n- [layout@v0.2.14](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.14)\\n- [layout@v0.2.15](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.15)\\n- [layout@v0.2.16](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.16)\\n- [layout@v0.2.17](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.17)\\n- [layout@v0.2.18](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.18)\\n- [layout@v0.2.19](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.19)\\n- [layout@v0.2.20](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.20)\\n- [layout@v0.2.21](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.21)\\n- [layout@v0.2.22](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.22)\\n- [layout@v0.2.23](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.23)\\n- [layout@v0.2.24](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.24)\\n- [layout@v0.2.25](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.25)\\n- [layout@v0.2.26](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.26)\\n- [layout@v0.2.27](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.27)\\n- [layout@v0.2.28](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.28)\\n- [layout@v0.2.29](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.29)\\n- [layout@v0.2.30](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.30)\\n- [layout@v0.2.31](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.31)\\n- [layout@v0.2.32](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.32)\\n- [layout@v0.2.33](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.33)\\n- [layout@v0.2.34](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.34)\\n- [layout@v0.2.35](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.35)\\n- [layout@v0.2.36](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.36)\\n- [layout@v0.2.37](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.37)\\n- [layout@v0.2.38](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.38)\\n- [layout@v0.2.39](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.39)\\n- [theme@v3.15.5](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%403.15.5)\\n- [theme@v3.16.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%403.16.0)\\n- [theme@v3.17.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%403.17.0)\\n- [theme@v3.17.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme%403.17.1)"},{"id":"17.17.3","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.17.3","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/17.17.3.mdx","title":"Release 17.17.3","description":"Den h\xe4r posten samlar det viktigaste sedan 17.10.0 \u2014 ett nytt layoutpaket, flera nya komponenter och en hel del f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar.","date":"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v17","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-17"}],"readingTime":5.53,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"17.17.3","title":"Release 17.17.3","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v17"],"date":"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 17.26.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.26.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 17.10.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.10.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r posten samlar det viktigaste sedan 17.10.0 \u2014 ett nytt layoutpaket, flera nya komponenter och en hel del f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar.\\n\\n| Paket                  | Version   |\\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\\n| `@midas-ds/components` | `17.17.3` |\\n| `@midas-ds/layout`     | `0.2.11`  |\\n| `@midas-ds/theme`      | `3.15.4`  |\\n\\n## \u{1F4E6} @midas-ds/layout \u2014 nu i beta\\n\\n`@midas-ds/layout` \xe4r tillg\xe4ngligt och redo att b\xf6rja anv\xe4ndas. Det \xe4r det nya s\xe4ttet att bygga layouter i Midas \u2014 ett komponentbaserat API d\xe4r du s\xe4tter ihop strukturen med JSX i st\xe4llet f\xf6r att konfigurera en enda stor komponent via props.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport {\\n  Layout,\\n  LayoutContent,\\n  Main,\\n  Header,\\n  HeaderActions,\\n  HeaderAction,\\n  Sidebar,\\n  Navigation,\\n  NavigationLink,\\n  Navbar,\\n} from \'@midas-ds/layout\'\\n\\n<Layout>\\n  <Header>\\n    <HeaderActions>\\n      <HeaderAction icon={<User />}>Anna Andersson</HeaderAction>\\n    </HeaderActions>\\n  </Header>\\n\\n  <LayoutContent>\\n    <Sidebar title=\'Min applikation\'>\\n      <Navigation>\\n        <NavigationLink\\n          href=\'/\'\\n          icon={<House />}\\n          isActive\\n        >\\n          Hem\\n        </NavigationLink>\\n      </Navigation>\\n    </Sidebar>\\n    <Main>{/* ditt inneh\xe5ll */}</Main>\\n  </LayoutContent>\\n\\n  <Navbar>\\n    <Navigation>\\n      <NavigationLink\\n        href=\'/\'\\n        icon={<House />}\\n        isActive\\n      >\\n        Hem\\n      </NavigationLink>\\n    </Navigation>\\n  </Navbar>\\n</Layout>\\n```\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nPaketet \xe4r redo att ta i bruk \u2014 men r\xe4kna med att API, design och UX kan f\xf6r\xe4ndras under arbetets g\xe5ng. Vi tar g\xe4rna emot feedback.\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm install @midas-ds/layout\\n```\\n\\nSe [dokumentationen](/components/layout/get-started) och [migrationsguiden](/components/layout/migration) f\xf6r mer information.\\n\\n### Vad h\xe4nder med gamla Layout?\\n\\n`Layout` fr\xe5n `@midas-ds/components` forts\xe4tter att fungera, men kommer inte att f\xe5 nya funktioner. Nya projekt b\xf6r anv\xe4nda `@midas-ds/layout`.\\n\\n### Panel\\n\\n`Panel` \xe4r en ny komponent i `@midas-ds/layout` f\xf6r detaljvyer och sidopaneler. Den st\xf6der tv\xe5 l\xe4gen:\\n\\n- **overlay** \u2014 \xf6ppnar som ett lager ovanp\xe5 inneh\xe5llet\\n- **push** \u2014 skjuter undan inneh\xe5llet och tar upp plats i layouten\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { Panel, PanelContent } from \'@midas-ds/layout\'\\n\\n<Panel\\n  id=\'details\'\\n  title=\'Detaljer\'\\n  variant=\'push\'\\n>\\n  <PanelContent>...</PanelContent>\\n</Panel>\\n```\\n\\nPanel har sedan ut\xf6kats med en `actions`-prop f\xf6r att placera knappar i rubrikraden:\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { Button } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\nimport { Panel, PanelContent } from \'@midas-ds/layout\'\\n\\n<Panel\\n  id=\'details\'\\n  title=\'Detaljer\'\\n  variant=\'push\'\\n  actions={<Button variant=\'secondary\'>Redigera</Button>}\\n>\\n  <PanelContent>...</PanelContent>\\n</Panel>\\n```\\n\\n### Sidebar-animationer\\n\\nSidomenyn animerar nu titeln och navigationsrubrikerna mjukt vid kollaps och expansion. Animationen \xe4r omgjord f\xf6r b\xe4ttre prestanda.\\n\\n### \xd6vrigt i layoutpaketet\\n\\nPaketet har \xe4ven f\xe5tt en `Header`-komponent med st\xf6d f\xf6r logotyp, systemnamn och \xe5tg\xe4rdsknappar.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n### @midas-ds/components\\n\\n#### TimeField\\n\\n[`TimeField`](/components/timefield) \xe4r en ny komponent f\xf6r att mata in klockslag. Den delar API och stil med `DateField`.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { TimeField } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n\\n<TimeField label=\'Starttid\' />\\n```\\n\\n#### Card \u2014 CardHeader och CardBody\\n\\n`Card` har f\xe5tt `CardHeader` och `CardBody` som ers\xe4tter de gamla slot-baserade m\xf6nstren. Det gamla API:et \xe4r markerat som deprecated.\\n\\n```tsx\\n// F\xf6re\\n<Card heading=\'Rubrik\'>Inneh\xe5ll</Card>\\n\\n// Efter\\n<Card>\\n  <CardHeader>Rubrik</CardHeader>\\n  <CardBody>Inneh\xe5ll</CardBody>\\n</Card>\\n```\\n\\n#### ColorSchemeSwitch \u2014 kontrollerat l\xe4ge\\n\\n`ColorSchemeSwitch` st\xf6der nu kontrollerat l\xe4ge via `scheme` och `onSchemeChange`. Anv\xe4nd det n\xe4r du vill spara valet externt, t.ex. i `localStorage` eller i serverstatus.\\n\\n```tsx\\nconst [scheme, setScheme] = useState<ColorScheme>(\'light dark\')\\n\\n<ColorSchemeSwitch\\n  scheme={scheme}\\n  onSchemeChange={setScheme}\\n/>\\n```\\n\\n#### ColorSchemeSwitchMenu \u2014 kompakt dropdown\\n\\n`ColorSchemeSwitchMenu` \xe4r en ny kompakt variant av `ColorSchemeSwitch` avsedd f\xf6r att b\xe4ddas in i menyer \u2014 t.ex. i en `MobileMenu` eller en header\xe5tg\xe4rd.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { ColorSchemeSwitchMenu } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n\\n<ColorSchemeSwitchMenu />\\n```\\n\\n#### \xd6vriga till\xe4gg\\n\\n- **ContrastFilled:** Nytt ikon f\xf6r att signalera kontrastl\xe4ge \u2014 `import { ContrastFilled } from \'@midas-ds/components\'`.\\n- **ComboBox:** Ny prop `listBoxProps` f\xf6r att skicka props direkt till listrutan.\\n- **Select:** Ny prop `popoverProps` f\xf6r att skicka props till popoverkontainern.\\n- **Select:** `SelectAll` nollst\xe4ller nu valideringsstatus korrekt.\\n- **Radio, Accordion:** `children` kan nu vara en funktion (render prop).\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n### @midas-ds/components\\n\\n- **Modal** \u267F \u2014 Fokusringen visas nu korrekt p\xe5 dialogen vid tangentbordsnavigering, s\xe5 att det \xe4r tydligt var fokus befinner sig f\xf6r tangentbordsanv\xe4ndare.\\n- **Modal** \u2014 Scrollbar-gap i dialogen \xe4r fixat \u2014 `overflow-y` \xe4r nu satt p\xe5 dialogelementet.\\n- **Tag** \u2014 F\xe4rgtokens har f\xe5tt dedikerade primitiver i temat f\xf6r b\xe4ttre separation.\\n- **DateField, TimeField** \u2014 B\xe5da \xe4r nu wrappade i `forwardRef`.\\n- **Select** \u2014 Obligatorisk validering aktiveras nu korrekt n\xe4r alla valda alternativ rensas.\\n- **Select, ComboBox** \u2014 Listrutan har nu en relativ maxh\xf6jd och scrollar korrekt i tr\xe5nga layouter.\\n- **SearchField** \u2014 Skickar nu formul\xe4ret p\xe5 Enter-tangent \xe4ven utan `onSubmit`-prop.\\n- **SearchField** \u2014 `inputMode=\\"search\\"` satt som standard.\\n- **Card** \u2014 Marginal-kollaps inuti `CardBody` \xe4r f\xf6rhindrad.\\n- **Card** \u267F \u2014 Rubrikniv\xe5n i horisontellt l\xe4ge \xe4r korrigerad f\xf6r korrekt dokumentstruktur, vilket p\xe5verkar sk\xe4rml\xe4sares navigation.\\n- **Calendar** \u2014 Chevronstorlek i `CalendarHeader` \xe4r satt till korrekt 20 px.\\n- **Grid** \u2014 Flex-wrap-beteendet f\xf6r kolumner \xe4r korrigerat.\\n- **Link** \u267F \u2014 Nytt visuellt dolt label p\xe5 ikonerna \\"\xf6ppnas i nytt f\xf6nster\\" och \\"ladda ner\\", s\xe5 att sk\xe4rml\xe4sare f\xe5r ett meningsfullt alternativ till den visuella ikonen.\\n- **Accordion** \u2014 `type`-prop ignoreras nu korrekt n\xe4r `isContained` \xe4r false.\\n- **Table** \u267F \u{1F4F1} \u2014 Sorteringsikonen visas nu vid l\xe5g opacitet p\xe5 pekenheter och uppfyller WCAG 1.4.11-kravet p\xe5 3:1 kontrast f\xf6r UI-element.\\n- **Flera komponenter** \u{1F4F1} \u2014 Hover- och tryckstilar \xe4r f\xf6rb\xe4ttrade p\xe5 peksk\xe4rmar: `:hover` ersatt med `[data-hovered]` och hover-regler wrappade i `@media (hover: hover)`, s\xe5 att knappar inte fastnar i hover-tillst\xe5nd efter tryck. Ber\xf6rda: `Checkbox`, `Card`, `Select`, `Calendar`, `DateField`, `ListBox`, `LinkButton`, `Link`.\\n\\n### @midas-ds/layout\\n\\n- **Sidebar** \u2014 Kollapsa/expandera-animationen \xe4r omgjord f\xf6r b\xe4ttre prestanda.\\n- **Main** \u2014 Padding p\xe5 huvudinneh\xe5llet \xe4r korrigerad.\\n- **MobileMenu** \u{1F4F1} \u2014 Overlay-bakgrunden visas nu korrekt p\xe5 mobil.\\n- **Panel** \u{1F4F1} \u2014 Push-varianten fungerar nu korrekt p\xe5 mobil med h\xf6jd\xf6verg\xe5ng.\\n- **Layout** \u2014 Paketet exporterar nu en reset-CSS som kan importeras separat.\\n\\n### @midas-ds/theme\\n\\n- **Button** \u2014 Opacitetstokens anv\xe4nds nu f\xf6r hover/aktiva tillst\xe5nd p\xe5 sekund\xe4r- och terti\xe4rknappar, samt f\xf6r `disabled`-bakgrunden.\\n- **Icons** \u2014 V\xe4rdena f\xf6r `icon` och `icon-sm` storlekstokens \xe4r korrigerade \u2014 de var f\xf6rv\xe4xlade.\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v17.11.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.11.0)\\n- [components@v17.12.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.12.0)\\n- [components@v17.13.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.13.0)\\n- [components@v17.14.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.14.0)\\n- [components@v17.15.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.15.0)\\n- [components@v17.16.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.16.0)\\n- [components@v17.17.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.17.0)\\n- [components@v17.17.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.17.1)\\n- [components@v17.17.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.17.2)\\n- [components@v17.17.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.17.3)\\n- [layout@v0.0.44](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.0.44)\\n- [layout@v0.1.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.1.0)\\n- [layout@v0.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.0)\\n- [layout@v0.2.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.1)\\n- [layout@v0.2.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.2)\\n- [layout@v0.2.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.3)\\n- [layout@v0.2.4](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.4)\\n- [layout@v0.2.5](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.5)\\n- [layout@v0.2.6](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.6)\\n- [layout@v0.2.7](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.7)\\n- [layout@v0.2.8](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.8)\\n- [layout@v0.2.9](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.9)\\n- [layout@v0.2.10](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.10)\\n- [layout@v0.2.11](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/layout%400.2.11)"},{"id":"17.10.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.10.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/17.10.0.mdx","title":"Release 17.10.0","description":"Sedan v17.0.0 har vi sl\xe4ppt en rad f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar \u2014 en ny komponent, nya props, semantiska f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar och ett par viktiga namnbyten p\xe5 design tokens. H\xe4r \xe4r det viktigaste.","date":"2026-03-19T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v17","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-17"}],"readingTime":2.11,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"17.10.0","title":"Release 17.10.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v17"],"date":"2026-03-19T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 17.17.3","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.17.3"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 17.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.0.0"}},"content":"Sedan v17.0.0 har vi sl\xe4ppt en rad f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar \u2014 en ny komponent, nya props, semantiska f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar och ett par viktiga namnbyten p\xe5 design tokens. H\xe4r \xe4r det viktigaste.\\n\\n## \u{1F195} Ny komponent: FileList\\n\\n`FileList` och `FileListItem` \xe4r nya komponenter f\xf6r att visa uppladdade filer med st\xf6d f\xf6r borttagning. Perfekt att kombinera med `FileTrigger`.\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { FileList, FileListItem } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n\\n<FileList>\\n  <FileListItem\\n    fileName=\\"dokument.pdf\\"\\n    fileSize={204800}\\n    onDelete={() => handleDelete(\'dokument.pdf\')}\\n  />\\n</FileList>\\n```\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n### Tag \u2014 ny `color` prop och ikon-st\xf6d\\n\\nTag har f\xe5tt en `color` prop med ett flertal f\xe4rgvarianter. Det g\xe5r nu \xe4ven att placera en ikon inuti taggen med korrekt spacing.\\n\\nProp `dismissable` \xe4r markerad som deprecated \u2014 anv\xe4nd `isDismissable` i st\xe4llet.\\n\\n```tsx\\n// F\xf6re\\n<Tag dismissable>Tagg</Tag>\\n\\n// Efter\\n<Tag isDismissable>Tagg</Tag>\\n```\\n\\n### Tabs \u2014 ny `size` prop\\n\\n`Tabs` st\xf6djer nu `size=\\"large\\"` och `size=\\"medium\\"` (standard).\\n\\n```tsx\\n<Tabs size=\\"large\\">...</Tabs>\\n```\\n\\n### InfoBanner \u2014 semantisk f\xf6rb\xe4ttring och listst\xf6d\\n\\n`InfoBanner` renderas nu som `<aside>` i st\xe4llet f\xf6r `<div>`. Det g\xf6r komponenten till ett landm\xe4rke som sk\xe4rml\xe4sare kan identifiera och navigera till \u2014 en tydlig tillg\xe4nglighetsf\xf6rb\xe4ttring. Komponenten hanterar nu \xe4ven `<ul>`-listor inuti bannern med korrekt stil.\\n\\n### TextField \u2014 l\xf6senordsvisning\\n\\n`TextField` av typen `password` har f\xe5tt en visa/d\xf6lj-knapp f\xf6r l\xf6senordsf\xe4ltet. Edge-webbl\xe4sarens inbyggda reveal-knapp d\xf6ljs automatiskt f\xf6r att undvika dubbla knappar.\\n\\n### SearchField \u2014 omskriven p\xe5 React Aria\\n\\n`SearchField` \xe4r omskriven p\xe5 RAC:s `SearchField`-komponent. Den inbyggda s\xf6kknappen \xe4r nu deprecated och kommer att tas bort i v18. Anv\xe4nd `showButton={false}` f\xf6r att opt:a in i v18-beteendet redan idag och l\xe4gg till en egen knapp om du beh\xf6ver en.\\n\\n```tsx\\n// F\xf6re\\n<SearchField />\\n\\n// Efter\\n<SearchField showButton={false} />\\n```\\n\\n### ColorSchemeSwitch \u2014 ny `defaultScheme` prop\\n\\nProp `defaultValue` \xe4r ersatt av `defaultScheme`. `defaultValue` fungerar fortfarande men \xe4r markerad som deprecated.\\n\\n```tsx\\n// F\xf6re\\n<ColorSchemeSwitch defaultValue={new Set([\'light\'])} />\\n\\n// Efter\\n<ColorSchemeSwitch defaultScheme=\\"light\\" />\\n```\\n\\nFokusringen \xe4r nu korrekt synlig \xe4ven n\xe4r en redan vald knapp fokuseras via tangentbordet.\\n\\n### \xd6vriga till\xe4gg\\n\\n- **ComboBox:** Ny prop `listBoxProps` f\xf6r att skicka props direkt till listrutan.\\n- **Select:** Ny prop `popoverProps` f\xf6r att skicka props till popoverkontainern.\\n- **Select:** `SelectAll` nollst\xe4ller nu valideringsstatus korrekt.\\n- **Radio, Accordion:** `children` kan nu vara en funktion (render prop).\\n- **Layout:** `SidebarLinkProps` st\xf6djer nu `target` f\xf6r att \xf6ppna l\xe4nkar i nytt f\xf6nster.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **Breadcrumbs:** Styling justerad efter specifikation.\\n- **Layout:** Korrekt font-weight p\xe5 aktiva menyval.\\n- **Textfield:** Hover-f\xe4rg p\xe5 l\xf6senordsknappen. Borttagen aktiv bakgrund.\\n- **Theme (17.3.0):** CSS-variablerna `--midas-spacing-*` och `--midas-size-[0-9]*` \xe4r omd\xf6pta till `--midas-space-*` respektive `--midas-size-*`. Uppdatera i din CSS om du anv\xe4nder dessa direkt.\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v17.10.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components%40v17.10.0)"},{"id":"17.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/17.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 17.0.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 att rensa bort utfasad funktionalitet som har varit markerad som deprecated sedan v15.0.0. Vi har \xe4ven lagt till flera f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar och buggfixar sedan v16.3.1. Eftersom releasen inneh\xe5ller m\xe5nga breaking changes rekommenderar vi att avs\xe4tta tid f\xf6r migreringen \u2014 men det \xe4r v\xe4rt det, eftersom v17 l\xe4gger grunden f\xf6r framtida funktioner och fixar.","date":"2026-02-13T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v17","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-17"}],"readingTime":2.45,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"17.0.0","title":"Release 17.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v17"],"date":"2026-02-13T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 17.10.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.10.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 16.3.1","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.3.1"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 att rensa bort utfasad funktionalitet som har varit markerad som deprecated sedan v15.0.0. Vi har \xe4ven lagt till flera f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar och buggfixar sedan v16.3.1. Eftersom releasen inneh\xe5ller m\xe5nga breaking changes rekommenderar vi att avs\xe4tta tid f\xf6r migreringen \u2014 men det \xe4r v\xe4rt det, eftersom v17 l\xe4gger grunden f\xf6r framtida funktioner och fixar.\\n\\n**L\xe5nglivad version** \u2014 Ambitionen \xe4r att v17 ska kunna anv\xe4ndas under en l\xe4ngre period. Vi planerar att undvika breaking changes s\xe5 l\xe5ngt det \xe4r m\xf6jligt.\\n\\n## \u{1F4A5} Breaking Changes\\n\\nI den h\xe4r releasen har vi tagit bort funktioner som varit markerade som deprecated i tidigare versioner:\\n\\n- **tooltip:** Type `MidasTooltipProps` \xe4r borttagen. Anv\xe4nd `TooltipProps` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **accordion:** Type `MidasAccordion` \xe4r borttagen. Anv\xe4nd `AccordionProps` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **menu:** Type `MenuItemObject` \xe4r borttagen.\\n- **text:** Prop `variant` och type `TextVariant` \xe4r borttagna. Anv\xe4nd `size` prop ist\xe4llet.\\n- **breadcrumbs:** Interfacet `BreadcrumbItem` och det automatiska renderingsl\xe4get via `items` prop med `{href, title}`-objekt \xe4r borttaget. Anv\xe4nd det sammansatta API:et `<Breadcrumbs>` + `<Breadcrumb>` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **combobox:** `ComboBoxItem` och `ComboBoxSection` \xe4r borttagna. Anv\xe4nd `ListBoxItem` och `ListBoxSection` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **list-box:** Types `ListBoxItemElement`, `ListBoxSectionElement` och `ListBoxOption` \xe4r borttagna. `name` prop p\xe5 `ListBoxSection` \xe4r borttagen \u2014 anv\xe4nd `ListBoxHeader` som children ist\xe4llet.\\n- **legacy-select:** Hela `LegacySelect`-komponenten och `LegacySelectProps` \xe4r borttagna. Anv\xe4nd `Select`-komponenten ist\xe4llet.\\n\\n## \u{1F504} Migrering\\n\\n### Breadcrumbs\\n\\nI linje med React Arias dokumentation erbjuder vi mer kontroll \xf6ver renderingen av Breadcrumbs. Detta kr\xe4ver lite mera kod.\\n\\nTidigare:\\n\\n```tsx\\n<Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: \'/\', title: \'Start\' }]} />\\n```\\n\\nNu med en dynamisk renderingsfunktion:\\n\\n```tsx {2,3,4,5,6}\\n<Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: \'/\', title: \'Start\' }]}>\\n  {item => (\\n    <Breadcrumb id={item.href}>\\n      <Link href={item.href}>{item.title}</Link>\\n    </Breadcrumb>\\n  )}\\n</Breadcrumbs>\\n```\\n\\neller statiskt enligt:\\n\\n```tsx {2,3,4}\\n<Breadcrumbs>\\n  <Breadcrumb id=\'/\'>\\n    <Link href=\'/\'>Start</Link>\\n  </Breadcrumb>\\n</Breadcrumbs>\\n```\\n\\n### Combobox och Select\\n\\nCombobox och Select best\xe5r delvis av samma best\xe5ndsdelar, anv\xe4nder du sektioner i rullgardinen beh\xf6ver du justera hur du anger rubriken f\xf6r sektionen\\n\\nTidigare:\\n\\n```tsx\\n<ComboBox>\\n  {section => (\\n    <ListBoxSection\\n      id={section.name}\\n      name={section.name}\\n    >\\n      <Collection items={section.children}>\\n        {item => {\\n          return <ListBoxItem id={item.id}>{item.name}</ListBoxItem>\\n        }}\\n      </Collection>\\n    </ListBoxSection>\\n  )}\\n</ComboBox>\\n```\\n\\nNu:\\n\\n```tsx {4}\\n<ComboBox>\\n  {section => (\\n    <ListBoxSection id={section.name}>\\n      <ListBoxHeader>{section.name}</ListBoxHeader>\\n      <Collection items={section.children}>\\n        {item => {\\n          return <ListBoxItem id={item.id}>{item.name}</ListBoxItem>\\n        }}\\n      </Collection>\\n    </ListBoxSection>\\n  )}\\n</ComboBox>\\n```\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **breadcrumbs:** Breadcrumbs \xe4r omstrukturerade till separata komponenter med ett sammansatt API (`<Breadcrumbs>` + `<Breadcrumb>`).\\n- **date-field, date-picker, search-field:** Ny rensa-knapp (clear button) f\xf6r att t\xf6mma f\xe4lt.\\n- **button:** St\xf6d f\xf6r context props.\\n- **tooltip:** \xd6kad fontstorlek.\\n- **layout:** Ny navigeringsl\xe4nk-variant och klickh\xe4ndelse f\xf6r sidopanelsl\xe4nkar.\\n- **theme:** Ny invalid-state stil f\xf6r formul\xe4rf\xe4lt (box-shadow).\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **toast:** Synligt tangentbordsfokus (`focus-visible`) f\xf6r toast-regionen.\\n- **select:** Chevron-ikonen roterar nu korrekt n\xe4r select \xe4r \xf6ppen. Justerad horisontell padding.\\n- **select-styles:** Justerad h\xf6jd och pixelkorrigeringar f\xf6r react-select-komponenten.\\n- **date-picker:** Justerad h\xf6jd f\xf6r ikonknappar. Borttagen fokusindikator f\xf6r f\xf6r\xe4ldraelementet. Uppdaterade stilar f\xf6r ikonknappar.\\n- **date-field:** Uppdaterade stilar f\xf6r rensa-knappen. Korrekt invalid-kantlinje och box-shadow.\\n- **accordion:** Justerad padding f\xf6r oinneslutna inneh\xe5llscontainrar.\\n- **tooltip:** Anv\xe4nder nu CSS-variabler f\xf6r styling.\\n- **text, grid:** Borttagen global CSS till f\xf6rm\xe5n f\xf6r CSS Modules.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v17.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v17.0.0)"},{"id":"16.3.1","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.3.1","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/16.3.1.mdx","title":"Release 16.3.1","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 tillg\xe4nglighet, f\xf6rb\xe4ttrad komponenthantering och nya funktioner f\xf6r tabeller. Vi har lagt till st\xf6d f\xf6r React 19, f\xf6rb\xe4ttrat tillg\xe4nglighet med prefers-reduced-motion och forced colors, samt lagt till en ny Pagination-komponent f\xf6r Tanstack Table.","date":"2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v16","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-16"}],"readingTime":0.97,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"16.3.1","title":"Release 16.3.1","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v16"],"date":"2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 17.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/17.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 16.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.0.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 tillg\xe4nglighet, f\xf6rb\xe4ttrad komponenthantering och nya funktioner f\xf6r tabeller. Vi har lagt till st\xf6d f\xf6r React 19, f\xf6rb\xe4ttrat tillg\xe4nglighet med prefers-reduced-motion och forced colors, samt lagt till en ny Pagination-komponent f\xf6r Tanstack Table.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **table-styles:** Ny [Pagination-komponent f\xf6r Tanstack Table](/dev/tanstack-table#paginering) som g\xf6r det enkelt att hantera sidnumrering i tabeller.\\n- **components:** Alla forwardRef-komponenter har nu displayName f\xf6r b\xe4ttre debugging i React DevTools.\\n- **components:** CSS-animationer respekterar nu anv\xe4ndarens prefers-reduced-motion inst\xe4llning f\xf6r b\xe4ttre tillg\xe4nglighet.\\n- **theme, button, link-button:** Sekund\xe4ra knappar har f\xe5tt uppdaterad bakgrundsf\xe4rg.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **layout:** Aktiva menyalternativ visas nu korrekt \xe4ven p\xe5 undersidor.\\n- **layout:** F\xf6rb\xe4ttrat st\xf6d f\xf6r forced colors mode (Windows High Contrast) f\xf6r aktiva l\xe4nkar.\\n\\n## \u{1F527} Uppdateringar\\n\\n- **components:** St\xf6d f\xf6r React 19 samtidigt som bak\xe5tkompatibilitet med React 18 bibeh\xe5lls.\\n- **components:** React.forwardRef beh\xe5lls f\xf6r att bibeh\xe5lla bak\xe5tkompatibilitet med React 18.\\n- **components:** React.FC wrapper har tagits bort f\xf6r renare typning.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v16.3.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v16.3.1)\\n- [table-styles@v1.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/table-styles@v1.2.0)\\n- [theme@v3.9.3](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.9.3)"},{"id":"16.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/16.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 16.0.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 att rensa bort utfasad funktionalitet och g\xf6ra biblioteket l\xe4ttare att underh\xe5lla. Vi har \xe4ven lagt till f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar f\xf6r react-select-komponenten med en rensa-knapp och uppdaterat React Aria Components till senaste versionen.","date":"2025-12-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v16","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-16"}],"readingTime":1.01,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"16.0.0","title":"Release 16.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v16"],"date":"2025-12-17T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 16.3.1","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.3.1"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 15.3.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.3.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen fokuserar p\xe5 att rensa bort utfasad funktionalitet och g\xf6ra biblioteket l\xe4ttare att underh\xe5lla. Vi har \xe4ven lagt till f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar f\xf6r react-select-komponenten med en rensa-knapp och uppdaterat React Aria Components till senaste versionen.\\n\\n## \u{1F4A5} Breaking Changes\\n\\nI den h\xe4r releasen har vi tagit bort funktioner som varit markerade som deprecated i tidigare versioner:\\n\\n- **dropdown:** Hela Dropdown-komponenten \xe4r borttagen. Anv\xe4nd Menu-komponenten ist\xe4llet.\\n- **accordion:** Prop `variant` \xe4r borttagen. Anv\xe4nd `isContained` ist\xe4llet f\xf6r `variant=\\"contained\\"`\\n- **modal:** Type `DialogProps` \xe4r borttagen. Anv\xe4nd `ModalProps` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **spinner:** Prop `isOnColor` \xe4r borttagen. Spinnern anv\xe4nder nu alltid f\xe4rgen `icon-tertiary`.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **select-styles:** React-select har nu en clear indicator (rensa-knapp) med Lucide X-ikon som matchar designsystemets stil.\\n- **select-styles:** Dropdown-indikatorn visar nu r\xe4tt musmark\xf6r (`cursor: pointer`) vid hover.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **tooltip:** Ut\xf6kad definition av `children` prop f\xf6r ut\xf6kad kontroll av komponenten.\\n- **search-field:** `isRequired` prop \xe4r nu tillg\xe4nglig f\xf6r att markera f\xe4ltet som obligatoriskt.\\n\\n## \u{1F527} Uppdateringar\\n\\n- **components:** React Aria Components har uppdaterats fr\xe5n v1.13.0 till v1.14.0 f\xf6r f\xf6rb\xe4ttrad prestanda och nya funktioner.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v16.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v16.0.0)\\n- [select-styles@v1.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/select-styles@v1.2.0)"},{"id":"15.3.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.3.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/15.3.0.mdx","title":"Release 15.3.0","description":"I den h\xe4r releasen har vi gjort stora f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar av byggstrukturen som ger mindre bundle-storlekar och b\xe4ttre prestanda. Du kan nu v\xe4lja att importera enskilda komponenter f\xf6r \xe4nnu mindre bundles. Vi har ocks\xe5 lagt till nya typografitokens och f\xf6rb\xe4ttrat ett antal komponenter.","date":"2025-12-04T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v15","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-15"}],"readingTime":1.42,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"15.3.0","title":"Release 15.3.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v15"],"date":"2025-12-04T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 16.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/16.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 15.2.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.2.0"}},"content":"I den h\xe4r releasen har vi gjort stora f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar av byggstrukturen som ger mindre bundle-storlekar och b\xe4ttre prestanda. Du kan nu v\xe4lja att importera enskilda komponenter f\xf6r \xe4nnu mindre bundles. Vi har ocks\xe5 lagt till nya typografitokens och f\xf6rb\xe4ttrat ett antal komponenter.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **theme:** Tv\xe5 nya typografitokens, `body` och `body-small`, g\xf6r det enklare att styla br\xf6dtext konsekvent.\\n- **theme:** Nu kan du generera Tailwind-tema direkt fr\xe5n Midas tokens f\xf6r smidig integration med Tailwind CSS.\\n- **theme:** En ny `orange-100` f\xe4rg finns tillg\xe4nglig i f\xe4rgpaletten.\\n- **tabs:** Tabs kan nu renderas i en `contained` stil f\xf6r tydligare avgr\xe4nsning.\\n- **layout:** Sidebaren ligger nu p\xe5 en h\xf6gre z-index s\xe5 den inte t\xe4cks av annat inneh\xe5ll.\\n- **table:** Sorteringsikonerna i tabeller har f\xe5tt r\xe4tt visuella ikoner och reagerar nu snyggare p\xe5 hover.\\n- **table-styles:** Hover-effekter och transitions f\xf6r sorterings- och drag-and-drop-ikoner i tabeller.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **calendar:** Datumcellerna i kalendern \xe4r nu perfekt centrerade vertikalt.\\n- **calendar:** F\xf6renklad implementation f\xf6r att markera dagens datum.\\n\\n## \u{1F527} Refactor\\n\\n- **components:** Helt omgjord byggstruktur med st\xf6d f\xf6r tree-shaking och flera imports\xe4tt. Du kan nu v\xe4lja att importera allt (`import { Button } from \'@midas-ds/components\'`) eller enskilda komponenter (`import { Button } from \'@midas-ds/components/button\'`) f\xf6r mindre bundles.\\n- **calendar:** Calendar och RangeCalendar delar nu samma implementation f\xf6r mer konsekvent beteende.\\n- **theme:** B\xe4ttre exporthantering med fallbacks f\xf6r \xf6kad kompatibilitet med olika bundlers.\\n- **theme:** Subtila f\xe4rgjusteringar f\xf6r borders och varningar.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v15.3.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v15.3.0)\\n- [theme@v3.6.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.6.0)\\n- [table-styles@v1.1.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/table-styles@v1.1.0)\\n- [datepicker-styles@v0.2.6](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/datepicker-styles@v0.2.6)"},{"id":"15.2.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.2.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/15.2.0.mdx","title":"Release 15.2.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller st\xf6d f\xf6r read-only state i ett stort antal komponenter. Detta g\xf6r det l\xe4ttare att visa formul\xe4rf\xe4lt som \xe4r synliga men inte redigerbara, med tydlig visuell indikation.","date":"2025-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v15","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-15"}],"readingTime":0.7,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"15.2.0","title":"Release 15.2.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v15"],"date":"2025-11-07T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 15.3.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.3.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 15.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.0.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller st\xf6d f\xf6r read-only state i ett stort antal komponenter. Detta g\xf6r det l\xe4ttare att visa formul\xe4rf\xe4lt som \xe4r synliga men inte redigerbara, med tydlig visuell indikation.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **theme:** Nya f\xe4rgtokens f\xf6r read-only state har lagts till i temat.\\n- **read-only state:** St\xf6d f\xf6r read-only state med anpassad styling har lagts till i f\xf6ljande komponenter: **textfield**, **combobox**, **radio**, **checkbox**, **date-field**, **date-picker**, **calendar**, **text** och **label**.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **checkbox:** Korrekt ikon f\xf6r indeterminate state och refaktorerad styling.\\n\\n## \u{1F527} Refactor\\n\\n- **textfield:** Data-attribut har flyttats fr\xe5n template till CSS.\\n- **date-field:** Data-attribut har flyttats fr\xe5n template till CSS.\\n- **theme:** Read-only border color token har justerats.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v15.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v15.2.0)\\n- [theme@v3.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.2.0)"},{"id":"15.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/15.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 15.0.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller en helt ny select-komponent, baserad p\xe5 React Aria Components. Vi har \xe4ven passat p\xe5 att g\xf6ra en hel del mindre justeringar och buggfixar. Vi har sl\xe4ppt ett par mindre versioner sedan senaste major-versionen, men dessa release notes reflekterar allt som har h\xe4nt sedan dess.","date":"2025-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v15","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-15"}],"readingTime":2.63,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"15.0.0","title":"Release 15.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v15"],"date":"2025-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 15.2.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.2.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 14.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/14.0.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller en helt ny select-komponent, baserad p\xe5 React Aria Components. Vi har \xe4ven passat p\xe5 att g\xf6ra en hel del mindre justeringar och buggfixar. Vi har sl\xe4ppt ett par mindre versioner sedan senaste major-versionen, men dessa release notes reflekterar allt som har h\xe4nt sedan dess.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Ny select-komponent\\n\\nVi har ersatt v\xe5r gamla select-komponent med en helt ny, baserad p\xe5 [React Aria Components (RAC)](https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-aria/components.html). Detta ger oss en mer robust och tillg\xe4nglig komponent, med b\xe4ttre prestanda och fler funktioner. Den nya komponenten har st\xf6d f\xf6r sektioner, s\xf6kning, och multi-select med taggar.\\n\\n## \u{1F4A5} Breaking Changes\\n\\n- **select:** V\xe5r select-komponent \xe4r helt omskriven och baserad p\xe5 React Aria Components. Detta inneb\xe4r ett helt nytt API. Se dokumentationen f\xf6r mer information om hur du anv\xe4nder den nya komponenten.\\n\\n## \u{1F504} Migrering\\n\\nOm du anv\xe4nder v\xe5r `Select`-komponent i ditt projekt, finns det tv\xe5 v\xe4gar att g\xe5 vid uppgradering till v15.0.0:\\n\\n1.  **Uppdatera till den nya komponenten (rekommenderas):**\\n    Vi rekommenderar att du uppdaterar din implementation f\xf6r att anv\xe4nda den nya, React Aria Components-baserade `Select`-komponenten. Detta ger dig tillg\xe5ng till den senaste funktionaliteten, b\xe4ttre prestanda och f\xf6rb\xe4ttrad tillg\xe4nglighet. Se dokumentationen f\xf6r mer information om hur du anv\xe4nder den nya komponenten.\\n\\n2.  **Anv\xe4nd den gamla komponenten:**\\n    Om du inte har m\xf6jlighet att uppdatera din implementation just nu, kan du forts\xe4tta anv\xe4nda den gamla komponenten genom att byta importen fr\xe5n `Select` till `LegacySelect`. Din befintliga kod kommer d\xe5 att fungera som tidigare.\\n\\n    ```tsx\\n    import { LegacySelect } from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n    ```\\n\\n## \u2728 Select-komponenten\\n\\nDen nya select-komponenten, baserad p\xe5 React Aria Components, har nu st\xf6d f\xf6r samma funktioner som den tidigare versionen. Detta inkluderar:\\n\\n- St\xf6d f\xf6r sektioner med rubriker.\\n- F\xf6rb\xe4ttrad styling f\xf6r multi-select med taggar.\\n- M\xf6jlighet att visa valda v\xe4rden som taggar.\\n- B\xe4ttre hantering av fokus och tangentbordsnavigering.\\n- St\xf6d f\xf6r att visa en popover med mer information om ett val.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **spinner:** F\xe4rgen p\xe5 en spinner \xe4r nu som standard `icon-tertiary`. Property `isOnColor` \xe4r deprecated.\\n- **accordion:** F\xf6rb\xe4ttrat st\xf6d f\xf6r animationer i samtliga webbl\xe4sare.\\n- **datepicker-styles:** F\xf6rb\xe4ttrad styling av pilar f\xf6r att byta m\xe5nad.\\n- **date-picker:** En rad f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar av v\xe5r datepicker:\\n  - St\xf6d f\xf6r \\"forced colors\\" i Windows.\\n  - Medium-storlek.\\n  - Dagar utanf\xf6r aktuell m\xe5nad \xe4r nu dolda.\\n  - Hover-effekter.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **tabs:** Visningen av horisontella och vertikala tabbar \xe4r korrigerad.\\n- **list-box:** Justeringar av styling f\xf6r sektionsrubriker.\\n- **tag:** Synligt tangentbordsfokus f\xf6r alla taggar.\\n- **field-error:** Marginaler f\xf6r ARIA-dolda syskon \xe4r borttagna.\\n- **theme:** Enheter har lagts till f\xf6r panel-\xf6verg\xe5ngar, vilket l\xf6ser en bugg med trasiga animationer.\\n- **calendar:** Korrekt styling f\xf6r dagar utanf\xf6r aktuell m\xe5nad.\\n- **textfield:** Dubletter av prop-definitioner har tagits bort.\\n- **select:** Justering av styling f\xf6r \\"select all\\".\\n\\n## \u{1F4D6} Dokumentation\\n\\n- **select:** Dokumentationen f\xf6r select-komponenten \xe4r helt omskriven f\xf6r att matcha den nya komponenten.\\n- **spinner:** Dokumentationen f\xf6r spinner \xe4r uppdaterad med nya props.\\n- **date-picker:** En rad f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar av dokumentationen f\xf6r datepicker.\\n- **generellt:** En rad mindre justeringar och f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar av dokumentationen.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v15.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v15.0.0)\\n- [theme@v3.1.1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.1.1)\\n- [datepicker-styles@v0.2.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/datepicker-styles@v0.2.0)"},{"id":"14.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/14.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/14.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 14.0.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller mestadels mindre justeringar och buggfixar. Vi har \xe4ven passat p\xe5 att introducera ett nytt paket f\xf6r styling av datumv\xe4ljare.","date":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v14","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-14"}],"readingTime":2.88,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"14.0.0","title":"Release 14.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v14"],"date":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 15.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/15.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 13.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/13.0.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller mestadels mindre justeringar och buggfixar. Vi har \xe4ven passat p\xe5 att introducera ett nytt paket f\xf6r styling av datumv\xe4ljare.\\n\\n## \u{1F485} Nytt CSS-paket f\xf6r react-datepicker\\n\\nVi introducerar ett nytt paket, [`@midas-ds/datepicker-styles`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@midas-ds/datepicker-styles), f\xf6r att hj\xe4lpa till med styling av [`react-datepicker`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-datepicker). Detta \xe4r ett renodlat CSS-paket och \xe4r i ett tidigt beta-stadie. Vi uppmuntrar er att testa det och ge oss feedback.\\n\\n## \u267F\uFE0F Tillg\xe4nglighet\\n\\nVi har gjort en st\xf6rre genomg\xe5ng av hur v\xe5ra komponenter presenteras i Windows h\xf6gkontrastl\xe4ge (CSS `forced-colors`). Detta inneb\xe4r att komponenterna nu ska ha ett betydligt b\xe4ttre utseende och vara mer anv\xe4ndbara f\xf6r personer som anv\xe4nder detta l\xe4ge.\\n\\n## \u{1F4A5} Breaking Changes\\n\\n- **theme:** V\xe5r token f\xf6r `transition` har bytt namn fr\xe5n `transitions` till `transition` f\xf6r att vara mer konsekvent.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **theme:** Vi har uppdaterat v\xe5rt tema f\xf6r att f\xf6lja den nya [Design Token Community Group (DTCG)](https://tr.designtokens.org/format/) standarden, vilket g\xf6r det enklare att \xe5teranv\xe4nda v\xe5ra design tokens.\\n- **button:** Knappar har f\xe5tt ett ut\xf6kat `:not`-condition f\xf6r att b\xe4ttre hantera `pressed state`.\\n- **button:** Vi har f\xf6rhindrat att bakgrunden p\xe5 en knapp \xe4ndras n\xe4r den \xe4r nedtryckt och har `aria-expanded`, vilket ger en mer konsekvent anv\xe4ndarupplevelse.\\n- **heading:** Nu kan du anv\xe4nda en flagga f\xf6r att styra om en rubrik ska ha inbyggda marginaler eller inte.\\n- **theme:** Vi har lagt till nya variabler f\xf6r `spacing` f\xf6r att ge mer flexibilitet i layouten.\\n- **modal:** Det \xe4r nu m\xf6jligt att d\xf6lja st\xe4ngningsknappen i en modal.\\n- **modal:** Du kan nu skicka med en egen `className` till en modal f\xf6r att anpassa stilen.\\n- **datepicker-styles:** Vi har skapat ett nytt paket, `@midas-ds/datepicker-styles`, f\xf6r att enkelt kunna styla `react-datepicker`.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **core:** Vi har f\xf6rb\xe4ttrat hur v\xe5ra komponenter ser ut i `forced-colors-mode` f\xf6r b\xe4ttre tillg\xe4nglighet.\\n- **info-banner:** Vi har \xe5tg\xe4rdat en bugg som gjorde att `useEffect` k\xf6rdes tv\xe5 g\xe5nger i strict mode.\\n- **theme:** Vi har justerat storleken p\xe5 `line-height-100` och `font-size-70` f\xf6r att vara mer konsekventa.\\n- **storybook:** Vi har fixat ett stavfel i en bakgrundsv\xe4ljare i Storybook.\\n- **core:** Vi har lagt till en `clsx`-wrapper f\xf6r att b\xe4ttre hantera klassnamn fr\xe5n React Aria.\\n- **modal:** En modal kan nu hantera `open`-state som en kontrollerad komponent.\\n- **progress-bar:** Sk\xe4rml\xe4sare kan nu l\xe4sa av `valueLabels` f\xf6r en progress-bar.\\n- **accordion-item:** Vi har l\xf6st en bugg som p\xe5verkade tangentbordsfokus, animeringar och hover-effekter i `accordion-item`.\\n- **accordion:** Vi har \xf6kat specificiteten i CSS f\xf6r knappar i ett `accordion` f\xf6r att undvika stilkonflikter.\\n- **menu:** Vi har exporterat `MenuTrigger` s\xe5 att den kan anv\xe4ndas direkt.\\n- **list-box:** Rubriken i en `list-box`-sektion har nu r\xe4tt f\xe4rg.\\n- **popover:** Vi har justerat storleken p\xe5 popovers f\xf6r att de ska se b\xe4ttre ut.\\n- **theme:** `README`- och `CHANGELOG`-filerna inkluderas nu korrekt i v\xe5rt tema-paket.\\n- **popover:** Vi har f\xf6rhindrat att texten i en popover bryts f\xf6r tidigt.\\n- **table-styles:** Vi har tagit bort on\xf6diga release-inst\xe4llningar f\xf6r `table-styles`.\\n- **table-styles:** Vi har uppdaterat Vite-konfigurationen f\xf6r `table-styles` f\xf6r att inkludera `readme` och `tspaths`.\\n\\n## \u{1F3ED} Refactoring\\n\\n- **theme:** Vi har brutit ut knapp-specifika design tokens fr\xe5n `object-values.json` till en egen fil f\xf6r b\xe4ttre struktur.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v14.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v14.0.0)\\n- [theme@v3.1.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.1.0)\\n- [datepicker-styles@v0.1.2](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/datepicker-styles@v0.1.2)"},{"id":"13.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/13.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/13.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 13.0.0","description":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller en del st\xf6rre f\xf6r\xe4ndringar under huven. Vi har separerat v\xe5rt tema/css fr\xe5n komponenterna f\xf6r att","date":"2025-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v13","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-13"}],"readingTime":1.84,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"13.0.0","title":"Release 13.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v13"],"date":"2025-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 14.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/14.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 12.1.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.1.0"}},"content":"Den h\xe4r releasen inneh\xe5ller en del st\xf6rre f\xf6r\xe4ndringar under huven. Vi har separerat v\xe5rt tema/css fr\xe5n komponenterna f\xf6r att\\ng\xf6ra det mer flexibelt och f\xf6r att kunna erbjuda fler anpassningsm\xf6jligheter i framtiden.\\n\\n## \u{1F4A5} Breaking Changes\\n\\nCSS/Styles \xe4r nu tillg\xe4ngliga fr\xe5n `import \'@midas-ds/components/default.css\'` eller via `@midas-ds/theme`-paketet. L\xe4s mer\\np\xe5 [instruktioner f\xf6r att komma ig\xe5ng](/get-started/install/).\\n\\n## \u2B06\uFE0F Migrationsguide\\n\\nF\xf6r att uppgradera fr\xe5n version 12 till 13 beh\xf6ver du uppdatera hur du importerar CSS-filerna.\\n\\nTidigare importerades CSS direkt fr\xe5n komponentpaketet. Nu m\xe5ste du ist\xe4llet importera en global stilmall.\\n\\n**G\xf6r s\xe5 h\xe4r:**\\n\\n1.  Ta bort alla CSS-importer fr\xe5n `@midas-ds/components` som du har i din applikation.\\n2.  L\xe4gg till en ny import i din huvudsakliga `App` komponent eller motsvarande:\\n\\n```javascript\\nimport \'@midas-ds/components/default.css\'\\n```\\n\\nDenna import inneh\xe5ller allt du beh\xf6ver f\xf6r att komma ig\xe5ng.\\nOm du ist\xe4llet vill importera olika delar av Midas stilar kan du anv\xe4nda `@midas-ds/theme`:\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm install @midas-ds/theme\\n```\\n\\n```javascript\\nimport \'@midas-ds/theme/fonts.css\'\\nimport \'@midas-ds/theme/variables.css\'\\nimport \'@midas-ds/theme/color-scheme.css\'\\n```\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n- **components:** Ikonf\xe4rgen f\xf6r feedback-status har \xe4ndrats till `--midas-icon-primary`.\\n- **theme:** Signal-f\xe4rgerna har uppdaterats.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\n- **textfield:** Inbyggda (native) attribut har lagts till f\xf6r textfield och textarea.\\n- **table:** Korrekt bakgrundsf\xe4rg anv\xe4nds nu f\xf6r rader i tabellen.\\n- **layout:** Hash har tagits bort fr\xe5n main role querySelector.\\n\\n## \u{1F3ED} Refactoring\\n\\n- Temat har helt separerats fr\xe5n komponentprojektet och ligger nu i ett eget paket.\\n- Style dictionary build-skriptet har refaktorerats till en nx executor.\\n\\n## \u{1F423} Support f\xf6r Tanstack Table\\n\\nVi introducerar ett nytt paket `@midas-ds/table-styles` f\xf6r att hj\xe4lpa till med styling f\xf6r utvecklare som anv\xe4nder\\n[Tanstack Table](https://tanstack.com/table/latest). L\xe4s mer p\xe5 [instruktioner f\xf6r Tanstack Table](/dev/tanstack-table/).\\nDet \xe4r en css-fil i tidig version som vi hoppas kunna bygga mer p\xe5 som ett st\xf6d f\xf6r de utvecklare som vill komma \xe5t mer\\navancerade tabellfunktioner \xe4n vad som ing\xe5r i Midas-table.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 changelog:\\n\\n- [components@v13.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v13.0.0)\\n- [theme@v3.0.0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/theme@v3.0.0)\\n- [table-styles@v0.0.4](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/table-styles@v0.0.4)"},{"id":"12.1.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.1.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/12.1.0.mdx","title":"Release 12.1.0","description":"En tid har g\xe5tt sedan v\xe5r senaste release och vi \xe4r glada att f\xe5 dela med oss av lite nya funktioner och buggfixar.","date":"2025-09-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v12","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-12"}],"readingTime":1.5,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"12.1.0","title":"Release 12.1.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v12"],"date":"2025-09-10T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 13.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/13.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 12.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.0.0"}},"content":"En tid har g\xe5tt sedan v\xe5r senaste release och vi \xe4r glada att f\xe5 dela med oss av lite nya funktioner och buggfixar.\\n\\nV\xe5rt fokus har den senaste tiden legat kring v\xe5ra designtokens och dess struktur, vi kommer att beh\xf6va st\xf6ka lite till innan vi \xe4r helt n\xf6jda.\\nVi ber om urs\xe4kt f\xf6r r\xf6ran men vi hoppas kunna leverera ett mer f\xf6ruts\xe4gbart, konsekvent och anpassningsbart komponentbibliotek.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\n### Tokens\\n\\nUnder huven hanterar Midas designtokens med ett nytt verktyg vilket har medf\xf6rt vissa \xe4ndringar i namngivningen av v\xe5ra variabler.\\nVi p\xe5b\xf6rjar en utfasning av variablen `semantic` och `theme.css` och h\xe4nvisar er ist\xe4llet att anv\xe4nda variablen `variables` och `variables.css`.\\n\\nL\xe4s mer [h\xe4r](/get-started/contribute/tokens/dev-tokens/)\\n\\n### ComboBox\\n\\nComboBox st\xf6djer numer asynkron laddning, se [dokumentationen f\xf6r ComboBox](/components/combobox/#asynkron-laddning) f\xf6r detaljer hur du implementerar detta.\\n\\n### Menu\\n\\n[Menu](/components/menu) \xe4r en ny komponent med ett deklarativt API f\xf6r kompletterande menyer/kontextmenyer. Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar en utfasning av Dropdown som ers\xe4tts av Menu.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\nVi arbetar kontinuerligt med buggfixar, h\xe4r \xe4r n\xe5gra n\xe4mnv\xe4rda fixar:\\n\\n- `Accordion` har f\xe5tt extra marginal f\xf6r att tydligare visa sin fokusram vid tangentbordsinteraktion ([#780](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/780))\\n- `Badge` har f\xe5tt en ny bakgrundsf\xe4rg i m\xf6rkt l\xe4ge f\xf6r att klara krav p\xe5 f\xe4rgkontraster ([f40f2dad67](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/f40f2dad67))\\n- `Layout` visar aktivt menyval f\xf6r appar som anv\xe4nder en annan basepath \xe4n `/` ([4dec0a45ef](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/4dec0a45ef))\\n- `ListBox` och relaterade komponenter/typer ing\xe5r igen i komponentbiblioteket ([1f06b98610](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/1f06b98610))\\n- `TextArea`s storlek \xe4r nu justerbar ([6d04e25308](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/6d04e25308))\\n- `TextField` kallar inte l\xe4ngre p\xe5 events s\xe5 som `onBlur` fler g\xe5nger \xe4n n\xf6dv\xe4ndigt ([#769](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/769))\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/components@v12.1.0)."},{"id":"12.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/12.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 12.0.0","description":"I den h\xe4r releasen har vi fokuserat p\xe5 att f\xf6rb\xe4ttra den \xf6vergripande upplevelsen av v\xe5rt komponentbibliotek.","date":"2025-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v12","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-12"},{"inline":true,"label":"breaking-change","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/breaking-change"}],"readingTime":2.5,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"12.0.0","title":"Release 12.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v12","breaking-change"],"date":"2025-08-27T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 12.1.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.1.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 11.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/11.0.0"}},"content":"I den h\xe4r releasen har vi fokuserat p\xe5 att f\xf6rb\xe4ttra den \xf6vergripande upplevelsen av v\xe5rt komponentbibliotek.\\nVi har inf\xf6rt nya funktioner, fixat buggar och gjort n\xe5gra viktiga \xe4ndringar som kommer att p\xe5verka hur du anv\xe4nder\\nv\xe5ra komponenter. L\xe4s vidare f\xf6r att f\xe5 veta mer om vad som \xe4r nytt i version 12.0.0.\\n\\n## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner och f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar\\n\\nVi har lagt till flera nya funktioner f\xf6r att g\xf6ra v\xe5ra komponenter mer flexibla och kraftfulla. Du kan nu:\\n\\n- **Anv\xe4nda fler statusar i `Accordion`:** Vi har lagt till m\xf6jligheten att visa fler statusar i v\xe5r `Accordion`-komponent, vilket ger dig mer flexibilitet att kommunicera olika tillst\xe5nd till dina anv\xe4ndare.\\n- **Anpassa ikoner i `Dropdown`:** Du kan nu l\xe4gga till anpassade ikoner i v\xe5r `Dropdown`-komponent, vilket g\xf6r det enklare att skapa ett konsekvent och visuellt tilltalande gr\xe4nssnitt.\\n- **Kontrollera tillst\xe5ndet i `InfoBanner`:** Vi har inf\xf6rt ett kontrollerat tillst\xe5nd f\xf6r v\xe5r `InfoBanner`-komponent, vilket ger dig mer kontroll \xf6ver n\xe4r och hur den visas.\\n- **Virtualiserad tabell:** Vi har lagt till ett recept f\xf6r en virtualiserad tabell, vilket g\xf6r det m\xf6jligt att visa st\xf6rre datam\xe4ngder utan att kompromissa med prestandan.\\n- **Exportera tokens som CS:** Vi har implementerat export av v\xe5ra tokens som CSS vilket g\xf6r det enklare att anpassa utseendet p\xe5 dina komponenter och s\xe4kerst\xe4lla att din CSS \xe4r giltig.\\n- **Titel i `Modal`:** Vi har flyttat titeln i v\xe5r `Modal`-komponent till sidhuvudet och \xe4ndrat den till en `h2`-rubrik. Vi har ocks\xe5 tagit bort marginalen och centrerat den vertikalt f\xf6r att skapa en mer balanserad och visuellt tilltalande design.\\n\\n## \u26A0\uFE0F Breaking Changes\\n\\nDen h\xe4r versionen inneh\xe5ller n\xe5gra viktiga \xe4ndringar som kan kr\xe4va att du uppdaterar din kod. Vi har gjort dessa \xe4ndringar f\xf6r att f\xf6rb\xe4ttra den \xf6vergripande kvaliteten och konsekvensen i v\xe5rt komponentbibliotek.\\n\\n- **Borttagning av funktioner som varit deprecated:** Vi har tagit bort ett antal funktioner, props och typer som tidigare har varit markerade som deprecated. Detta \xe4r en del av v\xe5rt kontinuerliga arbete med att h\xe5lla v\xe5rt API rent och konsekvent. De borttagna funktionerna \xe4r:\\n  - `BreadcrumbProps` (anv\xe4nd `BreadcrumbsProps` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `ComboBoxSelection` (anv\xe4nd `ComboBoxSection` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `Item` och `Section` fr\xe5n `combobox/types.ts` (anv\xe4nd `ListBoxItemElement` och `ListBoxSectionElement` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `Flex` fr\xe5n `grid` (anv\xe4nd `Grid` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `fluid` fr\xe5n `GridProps` (anv\xe4nd `isContained` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `FlexItem` fr\xe5n `grid` (anv\xe4nd `GridItem` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `col` fr\xe5n `GridItemProps` (anv\xe4nd `size` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `dismissable` fr\xe5n `InfoBannerProps` (anv\xe4nd `isDismissable` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `narrow` fr\xe5n `TableProps` (anv\xe4nd `size` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `tabs` och `label` fr\xe5n `TabsProps` (anv\xe4nd det deklarativa API:et med `TabList` och `TabPanel` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `Option`, `OptionItem`, `OptionSection` fr\xe5n `select/types.ts` (anv\xe4nd `ListBoxOption`, `ListBoxItemElement`, `ListBoxSectionElement` ist\xe4llet)\\n  - `fieldSkeleton` och `buttonBackgroundSkeleton` fr\xe5n `theme/tokens.ts` (anv\xe4nd `skeleton01` ist\xe4llet)\\n- **\xc4ndrade ikoner f\xf6r FeedbackStatus:** Vi har \xe4ndrat ikonerna f\xf6r FeedbackStatus i v\xe5ra komponenter f\xf6r att skapa ett mer konsekvent m\xf6nster. Om du anv\xe4nder `type` (`\'success\'|\'info\'|\'warning\'|\'important\'`) kommer str\xe4ngen `default` inte l\xe4ngre att vara tillg\xe4nglig.\\n\\nVi f\xf6rst\xe5r att dessa \xe4ndringar kan orsaka visst besv\xe4r, men vi \xe4r \xf6vertygade om att de kommer att leda till en b\xe4ttre och mer konsekvent upplevelse f\xf6r alla som anv\xe4nder v\xe5rt komponentbibliotek.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v12.0.0)."},{"id":"11.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/11.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/11.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 11.0.0","description":"\u{1F680} Features","date":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release-notes","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/release-notes"},{"inline":true,"label":"v11","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/v-11"},{"inline":true,"label":"breaking-change","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/tags/breaking-change"}],"readingTime":0.76,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"11.0.0","title":"Release 11.0.0","authors":"midas","tags":["release-notes","v11","breaking-change"],"date":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 12.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/12.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.4.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.4.0"}},"content":"## \u{1F680} Features\\n\\n- **file-upload:** Komponenten `FileUpload` \xe4r borttagen och ersatt av `FileTrigger` fr\xe5n React Aria. Detta inneb\xe4r att API:et f\xf6r komponenten nu \xe4r i linje med React Aria. Se dokumentationen f\xf6r mer information om hur du anv\xe4nder den nya komponenten.\\n- **theme:** Nya tokens f\xf6r `badge-background` har lagts till.\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixes\\n\\n- **link:** En bugg har fixats som gjorde att l\xe4nkar med `target=\'_blank\'` inte \xf6ppnades i ett nytt f\xf6nster.\\n- **popover:** En bugg har fixats som gjorde att l\xe5nga str\xe4ngar kunde fl\xf6da \xf6ver i en popover.\\n- **theme:** F\xe4rger f\xf6r \\"danger button\\" i dark mode har justerats.\\n\\n## \u{1F4D6} Documentation changes\\n\\n- Ett felaktigt `tsx`-exempel har korrigerats.\\n\\n## \u{1F527} Maintenance\\n\\n- Beroenden har uppdaterats.\\n\\n## \u26A0\uFE0F Breaking Changes\\n\\n- **file-upload:** Komponenten `FileUpload` \xe4r borttagen och ersatt av `FileTrigger`. Detta \xe4r en \\"breaking change\\" och kr\xe4ver att du uppdaterar din kod. Se dokumentationen f\xf6r `file-upload` f\xf6r mer information.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.4.0)."},{"id":"/10.4.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.4.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.4.0.mdx","title":"Release 10.4.0","description":"\u{1F680} Nya funktioner","date":"2025-07-02T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":1.32,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.4.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-07-02T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 11.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/11.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.3.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.3.0"}},"content":"## \u{1F680} Nya funktioner\\n\\nTabs exporterar nu samtliga Tab-komponenter fr\xe5n React Aria s\xe5 att komponenten enklare kan anpassas\\noch st\xe4mmer b\xe4ttre med ursprungligt API,\\n\\n- **tabs:** refactor tabs to support declarative children structure ([#678](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/678))\\n\\n## \u{1FA79} Fixar\\n\\nInga h\xe5rdkodade str\xe4ngar f\xf6r enbart svenska, komponenter g\xe5r att anpassa efter olika spr\xe5k. Samtliga komponenter\\naccepterar nu `className` f\xf6r att applicera egen css.\\n\\n- add translations for all text strings ([#689](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/689))\\n- **breadcrumbs:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#683](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/683))\\n- **calendar:** in range states ([3b7bcd03da](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/3b7bcd03da))\\n- **calendar:** change text color token for dates in range ([1656d6d7a1](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/1656d6d7a1))\\n- **checkbox:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#684](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/684))\\n- **checkbox:** add margin-bottom to checkboxgroup-items [run-chromatic] ([0637fd9a5d](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/0637fd9a5d))\\n- **color-scheme-switch:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#685](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/685))\\n- **file-upload:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#686](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/686))\\n- **layout:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#687](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/687))\\n- **radio:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#688](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/688))\\n- **search-field:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#690](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/690))\\n- **spinner:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#691](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/691))\\n- **theme:** new tokens for calendar date states ([0f819928d0](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/0f819928d0))\\n- **theme:** change dark mode color on calendarBackgroundInRange ([d745cb2adf](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/commit/d745cb2adf))\\n- **toast:** \u{1F484} accept custom className ([#692](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/pull/692))\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.4.0)."},{"id":"/10.3.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.3.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.3.0.mdx","title":"Release 10.3.0","description":"Nya funktioner \u2728","date":"2025-06-25T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.21,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.3.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-06-25T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.4.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.4.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.2.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.2.0"}},"content":"## Nya funktioner \u2728\\n\\n- **Popover:** Ny komponent, se [dokumentation f\xf6r Popover](/components/popover)\\n\\n## Fixar \u{1F489}\\n\\n- **Combobox:** Markerar f\xf6reg\xe5ende v\xe4rde vid musklick\\n- **Storybook:** Felaktiga tillg\xe4nglighetsbrister rapporteras inte l\xe4ngre i dark mode\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.3.0)."},{"id":"/10.2.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.2.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.2.0.mdx","title":"Release 10.2.0","description":"Nya funktioner \u2728","date":"2025-06-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.92,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.2.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-06-18T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.3.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.3.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.1.1","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.1"}},"content":"## Nya funktioner \u2728\\n\\n- **Skeleton:** har en ny prop `isOnLayer01` f\xf6r anv\xe4ndning p\xe5 alternativ bakgrund.\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av tokens `fieldSkeleton` och `buttonBackgroundSkeleton`, vad god anv\xe4nd `skeleton01` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **Grid:** Grid har ett nytt API med bland annat responsiva brytpunkter, l\xe4s mer under [dokumentation f\xf6r Grid](/components/grid).\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `fluid`, vad god anv\xe4nd `isContained` ist\xe4llet.\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `Flex`, vad god anv\xe4nd `Grid` ist\xe4llet.\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `col` propen f\xf6r `GridItem`, vad god anv\xe4nd `size` ist\xe4llet.\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `FlexItem`, vad god anv\xe4nd `GridItem` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **Table:** har en ny prop `size`\\n  - Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `narrow`, vad god anv\xe4nd `size` ist\xe4llet.\\n- **Calendar:** har nu st\xf6d f\xf6r disabled state\\n- **bundle:** Vi delar nu upp v\xe5r bundle i mindre \\"chunks\\" f\xf6r att reducera storleken p\xe5 appar som anv\xe4nder enstaka Midaskomponenter.\\n\\n## Fixar \u{1F489}\\n\\n- **Radio, Calendar** Vi hanterar nu css syntax errors for media queries\\n- **Calendar** Felaktig f\xe4rg f\xf6r dag-knapp \xe5tg\xe4rdad\\n- **TextField:** Radera `height:100%`\\n\\n## Kosmetika \u{1F3A8}\\n\\n- **LinkButton:** Byter ut Chevron-ikon till Arrow-ikon\\n- **Table:** Uppdaterar marginaler och utfyllnad\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.2.0)."},{"id":"/10.1.1","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.1","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.1.1.mdx","title":"Release 10.1.1","description":"Fixar \u{1F489}","date":"2025-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.35,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.1.1","authors":"midas","date":"2025-06-09T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.2.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.2.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.1.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.0"}},"content":"## Fixar \u{1F489}\\n\\n- Felaktig token som orsakade fel vid hover av `Button` \xe4r ersatt.\\n- Prestandaproblem vid stora datam\xe4ngder i `ComboBox` \xe4r \xe5tg\xe4rdat.\\n- Tillg\xe4nglighetsproblem vid anv\xe4ndning av sektioner i `ComboBox` och `Select` \xe4r \xe5tg\xe4rdat.\\n- Visuell bugg \xe5tg\xe4rdad i `DatePicker`.\\n- `Link` visar nu ikoner vid anv\xe4ndning av `target=\\"_blank\\"` och `download`\\n- `LinkButton` har nu st\xf6d f\xf6r `size=\\"medium\\"`.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.1.1)."},{"id":"/10.1.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.1.0.mdx","title":"Release 10.1.0","description":"Nya funktioner \u2728","date":"2025-05-23T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.42,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.1.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-05-23T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.1.1","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.1"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 10.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.0.0"}},"content":"## Nya funktioner \u2728\\n\\n- **Accordion** har en ny prop `hasBackground`\\n- **Select** anv\xe4nder `Virtualizer` f\xf6r f\xf6rb\xe4ttrad prestanda n\xe4r det finns m\xe5nga val. Select till\xe5ter numera\\n  att `id` \xe4r `Key` allts\xe5 `string | number`. Delvis ny style eftersom select nu anv\xe4nder checkbox fr\xe5n Midas.\\n- **Tag** exporteras som en separat komponent\\n\\n## Fixar \u{1F489}\\n\\n- **RadioGroup** till\xe5ter nu bara klick p\xe5 label, inte utanf\xf6r.\\n- **Skeleton** till\xe5ter att `className` skrivs \xf6ver.\\n- **LinkButton** har nu korrekt styles f\xf6r `isDisabled`.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.1.0)."},{"id":"/10.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/10.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 10.0.0","description":"Nya funktioner","date":"2025-05-15T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":2.33,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 10.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-05-15T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.1.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.1.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 9.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/9.0.0"}},"content":"## Nya funktioner\\n\\nI och med version 10.0 introducerar vi en ny storlek p\xe5 en rad komponenter, `medium`. Komponenter som ber\xf6rs och\\nnumera kan anv\xe4ndas i b\xe5de `size=\'large\'` och `size=\'medium\'` \xe4r:\\n\\n- [Button](/components/button)\\n- [TextField](/components/textfield)\\n- [SearchField](/components/search-field)\\n- [ComboBox](/components/combobox)\\n- [DatePicker](/components/date-picker)\\n- [DateField](/components/datefield)\\n- [Select](/components/select)\\n\\nDefault size \xe4r `\'large\'` i samtliga fall. `large` inneb\xe4r att inputf\xe4ltet \xe4r 48px h\xf6gt medan `medium` \xe4r 40px, f\xf6r\\nett mer kompakt utseende.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 9.x.x till 10.0.0\\n\\nEn del funktioner har varit deprecated sen 8.x.x eller tidigare och d\xe4rf\xf6r tar Midas tillf\xe4llet i akt att rensa\\nut gammal kod och \xf6verfl\xf6diga props/funktioner.\\n\\n:::info\\nKontrollera g\xe4rna koden innan uppgradering till version 10.x.x f\xf6r att s\xe4kerst\xe4lla att ni inte anv\xe4nder\\nn\xe5gon funktion eller komponent som numera inte fungerar som v\xe4ntat.\\n:::\\n\\n### Accordion\\n\\nAccordion har inte l\xe4ngre st\xf6d f\xf6r prop `type` f\xf6r att ha flera AccordionItems \xf6ppna samtidigt. Anv\xe4nd\\n`allowsMultipleExpanded` ist\xe4llet.\\n\\n```diff\\n- <Accordion type=\'multiple\'>/* items */</Accordion>\\n+ <Accordion allowsMultipleExpanded>/* items */</Accordion>\\n```\\n\\n### Button\\n\\nButton har inte l\xe4ngre st\xf6d f\xf6r `size=\'small\'`. D\xe4remot introduceras storleken `medium` och det g\xe5r att v\xe4lja\\nmellan `\'large\'` och `\'medium\'`, d\xe4r large \xe4r default.\\n\\n```diff\\n//highlight-next-line\\n-   <Button size=\'small\'></Button> // this is no longer valid\\n+   <Button size=\'medium\'></Button>\\n\\n```\\n\\n### Modal, DialogTrigger\\n\\nVarianten med ModalTrigger och Dialog \xe4r nu utfasad och ist\xe4llet ska DialogTrigger och Modal anv\xe4ndas. En aning\\nf\xf6rvirrande men principen \xe4r liknande och den uppdaterade versionen inneh\xe5ller m\xe5nga f\xf6rb\xe4ttringar.\\nSe dokumentationen f\xf6r [modal](/components/modal) f\xf6r hur DialogTrigger anv\xe4nds.\\n\\n```diff\\n- import {Dialog, ModalTrigger} from \'@midas-ds/components\' // no longer works\\n+ import {DialogTrigger, Modal} from \'@midas-ds/components\'\\n```\\n\\n### Spinner\\n\\nFr\xe5n och med 10.0.0 g\xe5r det inte l\xe4ngre att anv\xe4nda prop `dark`, anv\xe4nd `\xecsOnColor` ist\xe4llet.\\n\\n```diff\\n- <Spinner dark/>\\n+ <Spinner isOnColor/>\\n```\\n\\n### Tabs\\n\\nAnv\xe4nd `defaultSelectedKey` ist\xe4llet f\xf6r `defaultSelected`.\\n\\n```diff\\n- <Tabs defaultSelected={1}> /* tab content */ </Tabs>\\n+ <Tabs defaultSelectedKey={1}> /* tab content */ </Tabs>\\n```\\n\\n### Tokens\\n\\nTokens `borderInvalid` ers\xe4tts med `supportBorderWarning` och `textInvalid` ers\xe4tts med `textWarning`.\\n\\n```diff\\n- semantic.borderInvalid\\n+ semantic.supportBorderWarning\\n- semantic.textInvalid\\n+ semantic.textWarning\\n\\n```\\n\\nTokens `blue140` (`#25607F`) byter namn till `blue130` samt `blue170` (`#143C50`) byter namn till `blue150`, `purple140`\\nbyter namn till `purple110`.\\n\\n```diff\\n- blue140\\n+ blue130\\n- blue170\\n+ blue150\\n- purple140\\n+ purple110\\n```\\n\\n### useMessageFormatter\\n\\n`useMessageFormatter` f\xf6rsvinner till f\xf6rm\xe5n f\xf6r `useLocalizedStringFormatter` eftersom den \xe4r deprecated hos React Aria.\\n\\n```diff\\n- useMessageFormatter()\\n+ useLocalizedStringFormatter()\\n```\\n\\n### Label\\n\\nLabel variant f\xf6rsvinner i version 10.0.0, det g\xe5r allts\xe5 inte l\xe4ngre att anv\xe4nda `variant=\'label-01\'` eller `label-02`.\\nDefault \xe4r numera `label-02` och f\xf6r att uppn\xe5 variant `label-01`, anv\xe4nd komponent `Text` med `slot=\'description\'`.\\n\\n```diff\\n- <Label variant=\'label-01\'>Label</Label>\\n+ <Text slot=\'description\'>Label</Label>\\n```\\n\\n### Skeleton\\n\\nNamnfix p\xe5 prop `rectangular` som numera heter `rectangle` f\xf6r en mer konsekvent semantik. Animering \xe4r numera endast en\\nboolean, `isAnimated=true|false`.\\n\\n```diff\\n- <Skeleton variant=\'rectangular\' animation=\'wave\'/>\\n+ <Skeleton variant=\'rectangle\' isAnimated />\\n```\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v10.0.0)"},{"id":"/9.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/9.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/9.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 9.0.0","description":"{/ truncate /}","date":"2025-05-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.76,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 9.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-05-08T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 10.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/10.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 8.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/8.0.0"}},"content":"{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 8.x.x till 9.0.0\\n\\n### Card\\n\\nI version 8.3.0 introducerade vi ett nytt och mera modul\xe4rt API f\xf6r `Card`.\\nKomponenten som tidigare accepterade samtliga props \xe4r numera en kortyta som m\xe5ste kompletteras med ett urval fr\xe5n komponenterna `CardContent`, `CardTitle`, `CardActions`, `CardImage`, `CardActionArea` och `CardLink`.\\n\\nF\xf6r mer information l\xe4s [hur du anv\xe4nder Card](/components/card).\\n\\n### Tokens\\n\\nStrukturen p\xe5 tokens f\xf6r `lineHeight` och `size` under `typography` har \xe4ndrats.\\nImporterar du dessa v\xe4rden beh\xf6ver du justera din kod enligt:\\n\\n#### lineHeight\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { typography } from \'@midas-ds/components/theme\'\\n```\\n\\n```diff\\n-   typography.lineHeight01\\n+   typography.lineHeight10\\n-   typography.lineHeight02\\n+   typography.lineHeight20\\n-   typography.lineHeight03\\n+   typography.lineHeight30\\n-   typography.lineHeight04\\n+   typography.lineHeight40\\n-   typography.lineHeight05\\n+   typography.lineHeight50\\n-   typography.lineHeight06\\n+   typography.lineHeight60\\n-   typography.lineHeight07\\n+   typography.lineHeight70\\n-   typography.lineHeight08\\n+   typography.lineHeight80\\n-   typography.lineHeight09\\n+   typography.lineHeight90\\n-   typography.lineHeight10\\n+   typography.lineHeight100\\n```\\n\\n#### size\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { typography } from \'@midas-ds/components/theme\'\\n```\\n\\n```diff\\n\\n-   typography.size01\\n+   typography.fontSize10\\n-   typography.size02\\n+   typography.fontSize20\\n-   typography.size03\\n+   typography.fontSize30\\n-   typography.size04\\n+   typography.fontSize40\\n-   typography.size05\\n+   typography.fontSize50\\n-   typography.size06\\n+   typography.fontSize60\\n-   typography.size07\\n+   typography.fontSize70\\n-   typography.size08\\n+   typography.fontSize80\\n-   typography.size09\\n+   typography.fontSize90\\n-   typography.size10\\n+   typography.fontSize100\\n\\n```\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v9.0.0)."},{"id":"/8.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/8.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/8.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 8.0.0","description":"I version 8.3.0 introducerar vi breaking changes f\xf6r Card som var t\xe4nkta f\xf6r version 9. V\xe4nligen l\xe4s release notes f\xf6r version 9 f\xf6r mer information.","date":"2025-04-15T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.61,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 8.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-04-15T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 9.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/9.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 7.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/7.0.0"}},"content":":::warning\\nI version 8.3.0 introducerar vi breaking changes f\xf6r `Card` som var t\xe4nkta f\xf6r version 9. V\xe4nligen l\xe4s release notes f\xf6r [version 9](/release-notes/9.0.0) f\xf6r mer information.\\n:::\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 7.x.x till 8.0.0\\n\\n### Select\\n\\nV\xe4rdet i callbacken `onSelectionChange` f\xf6r komponenten `Select` har \xe4ndrats.\\nNumera skickas valda nycklar med en `Selection` type (`\\"all\\" | Set<string | number>`) n\xe4r anv\xe4ndaren justerar sitt val.\\n\\n```diff\\n-   onSelectionChange?: ((value: Selection | Key | Key[]) => void) | undefined\\n+   onSelectionChange?: ((keys: Selection) => void) | undefined\\n```\\n\\nDetta inneb\xe4r att du beh\xf6ver hantera om anv\xe4ndaren klickar p\xe5 \\"V\xe4lj alla\\" manuellt:\\n\\n```tsx\\nconst handleSelectionChange = (keys: Selection) => {\\n  if (keys === \'all\') {\\n    return setSelection(new Set(options.map(({ id }) => id)))\\n  }\\n  return setSelection(keys)\\n}\\n```\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v8.0.0)."},{"id":"/7.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/7.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/7.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 7.0.0","description":"{/ truncate /}","date":"2025-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.39,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 7.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-04-02T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 8.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/8.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 6.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/6.0.0"}},"content":"{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 6.x.x till 7.0.0\\n\\n`TextField` st\xf6djer inte l\xe4ngre `validationType`.\\n\\n### pattern\\n\\nOm du vill anv\xe4nda HTML native constraint validation, anv\xe4nd egenskapen `pattern`.\\nL\xe4s mer om [pattern p\xe5 MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input#pattern)\\n\\n### validate\\n\\nF\xf6r anpassad validering med tillh\xf6rande felmeddelande, anv\xe4nd `validate`.\\nL\xe4s mer om egenskapen under v\xe5r [dokumentation f\xf6r TextField](/components/textfield/#egen-validering)\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v7.0.0)."},{"id":"/6.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/6.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/6.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 6.0.0","description":"- Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av Dialog, v\xe4nligen anv\xe4nd Modal ist\xe4llet.","date":"2025-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.17,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 6.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-03-24T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 7.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/7.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 5.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/5.0.0"}},"content":"- Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `Dialog`, v\xe4nligen anv\xe4nd `Modal` ist\xe4llet.\\n- Vi p\xe5b\xf6rjar utfasning av `ModalTrigger`, v\xe4nligen anv\xe4nd `DialogTrigger` ist\xe4llet.\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v6.0.0)."},{"id":"/5.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/5.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/5.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 5.0.0","description":"Vi introducerar st\xf6d f\xf6r dark mode p\xe5 samtliga komponenter","date":"2025-03-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.12,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 5.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-03-17T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 6.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/6.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 4.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/4.0.0"}},"content":"Vi introducerar st\xf6d f\xf6r dark mode p\xe5 samtliga komponenter\\n\\n{/* truncate */}\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v5.0.0)."},{"id":"/4.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/4.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/4.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 4.0.0","description":"{/ truncate /}","date":"2025-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.23,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 4.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-03-10T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 5.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/5.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 3.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/3.0.0"}},"content":"{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 3.x.x till 4.0.0\\n\\n### Select\\n\\n`MultiSelect` ers\xe4tts av `Select`, v\xe4nligen anv\xe4nd `selectionMode` f\xf6r en flerv\xe4ljare:\\n\\n```tsx\\n<Select selectionMode=\'multiple\' />\\n```\\n\\nSe mer information om [hur du anv\xe4nder Select](/components/select)\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v4.0.0)."},{"id":"/3.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/3.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/3.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 3.0.0","description":"{/ truncate /}","date":"2025-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.28,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 3.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-02-28T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 4.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/4.0.0"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release 2.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/2.0.0"}},"content":"{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 2.x.x till 3.0.0\\n\\n### SearchField\\n\\n`SearchField` st\xf6djer inte l\xe4ngre `isRequired`. Beteendet kan efterliknas med hj\xe4lp av `validate`\\n\\n```tsx\\n<SearchField validate={v => !!v.length || \'Var god ange \xe5tminstone ett tecken\' />\\n```\\n\\nSe mer information om [hur du anv\xe4nder SearchField](/components/search-field)\\n\\nSe alla f\xf6r\xe4ndringar i detalj p\xe5 [changelog](https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas/releases/tag/v3.0.0)."},{"id":"/2.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/2.0.0","source":"@site/blog/release-notes/2.0.0.mdx","title":"Release 2.0.0","description":"{/ truncate /}","date":"2025-02-25T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.08,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Midas","title":"Midas Core Team","utl":"https://github.com/migrationsverket/midas","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020437?s=200&v=4","key":"midas","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release 2.0.0","authors":"midas","date":"2025-02-25T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release 3.0.0","permalink":"/pr-preview/pr-1425/release-notes/3.0.0"}},"content":"{/* truncate */}\\n\\n## Migrera fr\xe5n 1.x.x till 2.0.0\\n\\n### TextField, TextArea\\n\\n`maxCharacters` byter namn till `maxLength` f\xf6r enhetlighet"}]}}')}}]);